:: OC George and Timmy Intro [nobr]

/* Intro */

You are walking along the edge of the park, stretching your legs, when you hear some commotion coming from near the bathrooms. You rush over to find an intense sight. <span style="color:Yellow">A boy with curly brown hair sits on the ground, looking a little scared, as a black-haired boy stands above him, stick in his hand that he points at some very angry-looking highschoolers. Seems the two kids have run afoul of them.</span> <br>

        <<set _ad to [
            {
                Name: "OC George",
                State: {
                    Outfit: "Everyday",
                    Mouth: "Frown",
                    Blush: 1,
                },
            },
            {
                Name: "OC Timmy",
                State: {
                    Outfit: "Everyday",
                    Mouth: "Frown",
                    Eyes: "Mad",
                },
            },
        ]>>
        <<ad _ad>>

<span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“I- I’m sorry! I didn’t mean anything by it, really!”</span> The boy on the ground says, trying to defuse the situation. You notice he has a cute British accent, sounding very clear due to the nervousness in his voice. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“I just saw it and was curious, is all. Like I said, I can give you $20 as an apology if you really-”</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Fucking little perv!”</span> One of the highschoolers barks, <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Think you can sneak some looks at my underwear and pay me off like some slut? Fucking freak needs to be taught a lesson!”</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Try it!”</span> The kid with the stick waves it about to force the older kids back, <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“You may be bigger, but that just means you’ll fall faster and hit the ground harder!”</span> <span style="color:Yellow">The kid sure is brave, but with three against one you don’t think he’ll be able to last long against them. You could try to talk the older kids down, try to resolve this peacefully. Then again, you could also grab a stick yourself and run in swinging, try to scare them off before they have a chance.</span> <br>
<br>

<div id="choice">
	<<link "Try to resolve it peacefully<br>">>
    <<replace "#choice">>
        You run up between the two groups, holding your hands out as you tell them all to stop it! You only got a bit of the situation, but try your best to convince the older kids to let it go. You’re sure the kid didn’t mean anything by it. If they just let it go this once, they’ll never have to deal with either of them again. Plus, this is a family park. If they start whaling on them, someone might see and they’ll get in big trouble. <br>

        <<set _ad to [
            {
                Name: "Player",
                State: {
                    Mouth: "Happy",
                },
            },
            {
                Name: "OC George",
                State: {
                    Outfit: "Everyday",
                    Mouth: "Frown",
                    Blush: 1,
                },
            },
            {
                Name: "OC Timmy",
                State: {
                    Outfit: "Everyday",
                    Mouth: "Frown",
                },
            },
        ]>>
        <<ad _ad>>

        <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“The kid’s right. It’s not worth it.”</span> One of the highschoolers say to the angriest one, <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Come on, let’s just go.”</span> <br>
        <br>
        <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Yeah! Run away you cowards!”</span> The kid with the stick says. You quickly turn around and tell him he isn’t helping. <span style="color:LightGreen">Thankfully, the older kids seem more amused than anything by his threats.</span> <br>
        <br>
        <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Whatever. Let the brats be pervs on their own. Let’s go!”</span> The main highschooler turns away and starts to walk off, followed by his friends. The boy with the stick eyes them, hand firmly around the stick in case they change their mind. You swear you hear him mutter something under his breath <span style="color:Pink">but get distracted as the main highschoolers pants suddenly slip to his ankles! He trips to the ground in a lump, his spray paint designed boxer briefs exposed as he faceplants!</span> <br>
        <br>
        You and the boy on the ground watched stunned as the kids with the stick breaks out laughing, mocking the high schooler. You are worried they may return angry, but it seems their wounded pride causes them to flee for now, but that kid cut it close. <span style="color:BlueViolet">Weird, but must have been karma that his pants slipped down like that.</span> <br>
        <br>
        <<include"OC George and Timmy Intro 2">>
    <</replace>>
    <</link>>
	<<link "Run in with a stick<br>">>
    <<replace "#choice">>
        <span style="color:LightGreen">You grab the nearest stick and, without fear, run towards the group giving a loud battle cry! You swing the stick around violently, not really aiming, but smacking two of the boys in the sides as you crash into them.</span> The other kid with a stick smiles widely and jumps in with excitement, smacking the highschoolers in their knees and groins, causing high amount of damage! <br>

        <<set _ad to [
            {
                Name: "Player",
                State: {
                    Mouth: "Frown",
                    Eyes: "Mad",
                },
            },
            {
                Name: "OC George",
                State: {
                    Outfit: "Everyday",
                    Mouth: "Frown",
                    Blush: 1,
                },
            },
            {
                Name: "OC Timmy",
                State: {
                    Outfit: "Everyday",
                    Mouth: "Frown",
                },
            },
        ]>>
        <<ad _ad>>

        <span style="color:Pink">The main high schooler tries to fight back, but right as he does, in some ironic twist of fate, his pants slip down to his ankles, exposing his spray paint boxer briefs and causing him to faceplant into the ground in a heap!</span> <span style="color:LightGreen">Outnumbered and caught by surprise, the three highschoolers quickly get to their feet and retreat, shouting all sorts of nasty words back at you as they disappear into the distance.</span> <br>
        <br>
        <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Ya, you better run!”</span> The kid with the stick rushes forward a few feet, swinging his branch about threateningly. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Cowards. I was just getting warmed up.”</span> He scoffs, only having suffered a minor bruise while you are basically uninjured. <br>
        <br>
        <<include"OC George and Timmy Intro 2">>
    <</replace>>
