:: OC George and Timmy Intro 2 [nobr]

/* Intro */
<span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Thanks for the help kid.”</span> The boy turns to you, dropping the stick to the ground. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“I could have handled them myself, but I don’t mind the assist.”</span> He then turns to his friend on the ground, walking over and helping him up. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Are you okay? He didn’t hurt you when he shoved you, did he?”</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“I- I’m fine! Thank you.”</span> The boy smiles and stands up, <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Sorry for causing trouble. I was just curious and- Well, I didn’t expect them to react like that. Plus, you saw his underwear! It was so colorful and…”</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Heh, maybe try to resist sneaking a peek at everyone’s underwear.”</span> The boy laughs, <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Or at least give me a warning first. You’re lucky I saw you from the slide.”</span> Both boys share a laugh before turning to you, <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“I’m <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Timmy</span> and the little perv is <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">George</span>.”</span> <br>

        <<set _ad to [
            {
                Name: "Player",
                State: {
                    Mouth: "Happy",
                },
            },
            {
                Name: "OC George",
                State: {
                    Outfit: "Everyday",
                    Mouth: "Happy",
                },
            },
            {
                Name: "OC Timmy",
                State: {
                    Outfit: "Everyday",
                    Mouth: "Happy",
                },
            },
        ]>>
        <<ad _ad>>

<span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“I’m not a perv!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">George</span> protests, <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Like I said, it was just colorful and I was curious, is all.”</span> He sighs, holding out his hand and shaking yours. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“<span style="color:DarkTurquoise">George Cloony</span>. Thank you for the help and sorry if I caused any trouble.”</span> You think that his name sounds a little familiar but can’t quite place it. You tell him it’s no big deal, you just wanted to help. <span style="color:Pink">Though sneaking peeks at underwear can result in outcomes like that, though you understand the curiosity.</span> <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Right? There are so many fun designs! Plus, you can tell a lot about who a person really is by what they are wearing. Do you mind showing me-”</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Stop being weird.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Timmy</span> bops his friend on the head, <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“It would help in not scaring off everyone we meet.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">George</span> quickly apologizes, almost offering you $20 as an apology. <span style="color:Pink">This earns him another bop on the head.</span> <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Come on, let’s get back to your place before your curiosity causes anymore trouble. I’m tired and need to pee. You owe me a nap in your big bed for saving your bed. See you later, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">$Player.Name</span>! Maybe we can hang out sometime.”</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Yes! Thank you very much!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">George</span> says as he follows <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Timmy</span> off, <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“But my bed is big enough to share, right? And I have to go to, so maybe-”</span> You watch as the strange pair walks off to the west. <span style="color:LightGreen">Guess you’ve made some new friends.</span> <br>
